  "notable_quotes": [
    "The MAC-4 series are isostructural crs-type porous frameworks with 1D zigzag channels built from Zn3(OH)(dmtrz)3 and Zn2(COO)4 units.",
    "A solid-solution/MTV-MOF strategy enabled tunable incorporation of 5-substituted isophthalates without changing the MAC-4 framework.",
    "Mixed-ligand samples MAC-4-AB-x, -AC-x, -AD-x, and -AE-x were prepared at defined substitution ratios x = 0.3, 0.5, and 0.7."
